<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were fully $1.00 lower, instances 1.50 lower. - USDA US  1-3   220-270 lbs    58.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Uneven, over 500 lbs 1.00 lower; under 500 lbs 0.50 higher. Top $49.00. US 1-3    350-450 lbs    45.50-46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
